window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All three books in the <i>New York Times</i> best-selling trilogy available for the first time in one convenient bundle</b> </p> <p>\"Will you ever let me go?\" </p> <p>\"No, Nora,\" he replies, and I can feel his smile in the darkness. \"Never.\" </p> <p>On the eve of her 18th birthday, Nora Leston meets Julian Esguerra, and her life changes forever. Stolen away to a private island, she finds herself at the mercy of a powerful, dangerous man whose touch makes her burn...a man whose obsession with her knows no bounds. </p> <p>Her enigmatic captor is as cruel as he is beautiful, yet it's his tenderness that devastates her most. Drawn into his violent world, Nora must find a way to adapt and survive - and find light within the darkness. </p>"; 
